WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.329
Lingo.dev is built around
configurable translation engines.

2
00:00:04.729 --> 00:00:07.910
Each engine assigns a model
to each language pair,

3
00:00:07.910 --> 00:00:11.520
and CLI, React, and
GitHub tools reach it.

4
00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:14.785
General Translation
connects code context,

5
00:00:14.785 --> 00:00:17.165
shared terms, and Dashboard review.

6
00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:20.705
Its libraries render translations,

7
00:00:20.705 --> 00:00:23.456
and you wrap JSX in &lt;T&gt; as written.

8
00:00:23.856 --> 00:00:27.478
A Context Group shares one
Glossary and Custom Prompts across

9
00:00:27.478 --> 00:00:28.325
your projects.

10
00:00:28.725 --> 00:00:32.277
Your team reviews translations
in the Dashboard on every plan.

11
00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:36.284
Then run npx gt translate in CI,

12
00:00:36.284 --> 00:00:38.965
or let Locadex open pull requests.

13
00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:42.203
Your team now ships
Japanese with each release.
